    <node id="&quot;BELORECHENSKY DISTRICT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belorechensky District is an administrative district (raion) in Krasnodar Krai, Russia, located in the southern central part of the krai, bordering the Republic of Adygea. It is incorporated as Belorechensky Municipal District and has an administrative center in the town of Belorechensk.")</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0274-b7fa11523a04</data>
    </node>
